# Phase — Project Intelligence

## Product
RSI regime EA: visual + live bounce trades (v1.41).

## Regime (v1.29 freeze / ignite-once)
- OnInit: ONE 500-bar walk (ignite) → freeze `g_regimes` + keep `g_walk`
- New bar: `PhRegimeAdvance` only — never rebuild past colours
- Stick until INV/S&R leave rules fire (Buy/Sell Process)
- Resist = highest swing >=70 & <80 (never below 70; not on 80)
- Support = lowest swing <=25 & >20 (never above 25; not on 20)
- S&R line: regime enter → regime END
- No INV → leave stay >65 (sell) / <35 (buy)

## Trade (v1.41)
- BUY regime: bounce up from 35–40 or 50 → buy (arm on zone, fire on RSI close > prev)
- SELL regime: bounce down from 60–65 or 50 → sell
- Every bounce = new entry; lot 0.01; SL min 800 pips; **no fixed TP** (Div / regime exits)
- Regime change → CloseAll; red regular Div → close buys; green regular Div → close sells
- Live new-bar only (no ignite fills); HD does not exit
- Support HD entry: BUY regime + hidden bull → buy; SELL regime + hidden bear → sell (`PH_HD`)
- SL hit (any Phase deal) → CloseAll + **sequence lock** until helping HD (same regime)
- Regime change → CloseAll + **unlock** (nayi regime fresh sequence)
- Module: `Include/Phase_Trade.mqh`; magic `InpTradeMagic`

## Divergence / BOS / HD (v1.39 from Future2EA)
- Regular Div: nearest RSI tops/bottoms; 1st >60/<45; 2nd dead-zone bahar; path clean; nearest draw
- HD: nearest-in-time RSI extrema; 35–65; min ΔRSI; no BOS
- Phase_RSI: levels 20/35/40/50/60/65/80 all white solid
- Live flags: `newRegularBear` / `newRegularBull` on `SPhDivState`

## Drawing
- Prefix `PH_`
- Modules: Buy/Sell/Regime/SR/Draw/Dash/Div*/Trade + Types
- Dash: top-right M1..H1 regime pills (green/red) — Phase own, not F2E

## Companion
`Indicators/Phase_RSI.mq5` — RSI(14), levels 20/35/40/50/60/65/80

